# Example: Flash Sale Coupon Creation Tool Invocation

## Request Payload:
```json
{
  "tool": "woo_create_coupon",
  "arguments": {
    "code": "SUMMERFLASH25",
    "discount_type": "percent",
    "amount": "25",
    "description": "25% off summer collection flash sale",
    "expiry_date": "2026-08-31",
    "minimum_amount": "50.00",
    "individual_use": true,
    "exclude_sale_items": true,
    "product_categories": [18, 24]
  }
}
```

## Response Payload:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "coupon_id": 8412,
  "code": "SUMMERFLASH25",
  "discount": "25%",
  "status": "publish",
  "expires": "2026-08-31T23:59:59Z",
  "snapshot_id": "snp_woo_7781a"
}
```
